      `the person is the accused or a person who is not a party to the proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 672.51(8) the section bars that part of the record from being made available for inspection to the person` MEANS
    IF `it is a part of the record of the proceedings in respect of which the accused was excluded pursuant to subparagraph 672.5(10)(b)(ii) or (iii)` AND `the person is the accused or a person who is not a party to the proceedings`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "No part of the record of the proceedings in respect of which the accused was excluded pursuant to subparagraph 672.5(10)(b)(ii) or (iii)"

-- 672.51(9): notwithstanding (7) and (8), the court or Review Board may make any disposition information, or a copy of it, available on request to any person or member of a class of persons (a) that has a valid interest in the information for research or statistical purposes,
-- where the court or Review Board is satisfied that disclosure is in the public interest; (b) that has a valid interest in the information for the purposes of the proper administration of justice; or (c) that the accused requests or authorizes in writing to inspect it,
-- where the court or Review Board is satisfied that the person will not disclose or give to the accused a copy of any disposition information withheld under (3), or of any part of the record referred to in (8), or that the reasons for withholding that information from the accused no longer exist.
-- fork: F-GRANT-WHERE
