GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 672.51(9) the court or Review Board may make disposition information available to the person on request` MEANS
    IF `it is on request` AND (    (`the person has a valid interest in the information for research or statistical purposes` AND `the court or Review Board is satisfied that disclosure is in the public interest`)
                              OR `the person has a valid interest in the information for the purposes of the proper administration of justice`
                              OR (`the accused requests or authorizes the person in writing to inspect it` AND `the court or Review Board is satisfied that the person will not disclose or give to the accused a copy of any disposition information withheld under subsection 672.51(3), or of any part of the record of proceedings referred to in subsection 672.51(8), or that the reasons for withholding that information from the accused no longer exist`))
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the court or Review Board may make any disposition information, or a copy of it, available on request to any person or member of a class of persons"

